# Live vs helper vs archive

Paths are relative to `Custom Label Database/`.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `Custom_Label_Database.csv` | **Live** working DB. Edit this. |
| `Custom Label Database.xlsx` | Archive. Not live. |
| `support/Shirts Print Sizes.csv` | Shirt size-band W/H (A4/A3/Neck). |
| `support/Size References.csv` | Bags, paper, iron-on, exact `M## (UID)`, templates. |
| `support/BTC Product Export.csv` | Product catalog (UID join). Not UTF-8-safe; try cp1252/latin-1. |
| `support/Mocks Databse.csv` | Mocks guide (spelling is real). |
| `support/Workbook.xlsx` | Apparel Image restore (`Picture Name`). |
| `backups/` | Pre-change snapshots. |

Prefer scripts over opening the full CSV in the editor. `D:\Custom Label Database` and this tree have been the same project; treat as one until told otherwise.
